 0..1)&lt;br&gt;복합 외래키는 대표 컬럼 하나에 선을 연결:&lt;br&gt;· batch_configs (script_id, script_version_id) → script_versions (script_id, id)&lt;br&gt;· batch_runs (batch_id, config_number) → batch_configs (batch_id, number)&lt;br&gt;· batch_runs (script_id, script_version_id) → script_versions (script_id, id)&lt;br&gt;· skipped_windows (batch_id, config_number) → batch_configs (batch_id, number)&lt;br&gt;idempotency_records는 외래키 없는 독립 테이블" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1452" y="748" width="344" height="255" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c595" value="스크립트" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1452.0" y="1023" width="80.0" height="26" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c596" value="배치" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1538.0" y="1023" width="80.0" height="26" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c597" value="실행" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1624.0" y="1023" width="80.0" height="26" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c598" value="내부 처리" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1710.0" y="1023" width="80.0" height="26" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
